{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfYC9vyvrk7UCjYLqSvoV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"{\"statements\":[{\"statement_id\":\"S1\",\"role\":\"finding\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O141\",\"O142\"],\"text\":\"The east scaffold tower leans about two degrees toward the road. Two base plates rest on soft gravel after last week's rain.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S2\",\"role\":\"hypothesis\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O143\"],\"text\":\"Settling ground may be causing the lean.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S3\",\"role\":\"limitation\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O144\"],\"text\":\"Nobody has measured the lean since it was first noticed.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S4\",\"role\":\"next_step\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O145\"],\"text\":\"Take daily plumb readings before deciding on repairs.\"}],\"conclusion\":\"insufficient_evidence\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":690,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":311,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":56},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}